{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56268","headline":"云 · 幸夤逊","name":"云","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"片片飞来静又闲，楼头江上复山前。\n飘零尽日不归去，帖破清光万里天。\n（见《宛委别藏》本《分门纂类唐宋时贤千家诗选》卷十二。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"幸夤逊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56268.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56268","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}